./ R 00311000          $ 00311100 100                                           
         TM    SEGPTO+3,SEGPTLF A FULL TABLE ALREADY?          XA0045DK         
         BO    SKIPBLD        YES - NOTHING TO BUILD           XA0045DK         
         CLI   SAVER2+3,OLDVMSEG+KEEPSEGS+NEWPAGES+NEWSEGS     XA0045DK         
./ R 00626600          $ 00626610 010                                           
         L     R1,SEGPTO      THE PTO                          XA0045DK         
         N     R1,=A(SEGPTOM) ...                              XA0045DK         
         LR    R0,R7          THIS PTE                         XA0045DK         
         SR    R0,R1          ITS INDEX TIMES 4                XA0045DK         
         AR    R0,R0          TIMES 8: THE SWAP ENTRY          XA0045DK         
         AR    R0,R1          ...                              XA0045DK         
         TM    SWPOFF(R0),SWPSHR A COPY OF A MODEL'S?          XA0045DK         
         BO    NXTPAGE        YES - NOT AN ALLOCATION          XA0045DK         
         ABEND 2              ERROR - PAGE NOT RELEASED        XA0045DK         
./ R 00957000          $ 00957100 100                                           
         COPY  TIMER                                           XA0045DK         
SWPOFF   EQU   PAGTSWP-(PAGPFRA-PAGSTMP)+(SWPFLAG-SWPVM)       XA0045DK         
